                <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> May 2025</p>
                <p>
                    At Lottong Pinoy, we take your privacy seriously. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website at lottong-pinoy.com. Please read this policy carefully. By using Lottong Pinoy, you agree to the practices described in this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree with the terms of this policy, please do not access the site.
